I hate to be&nbsp;all&nbsp;<em>I&#39;ve played more than you</em>, but you might want to play a few more Apostate games before you make your final assessment. One easy game might be a fluke.I lost hideously the first time I played Omnitron (actually the first couple of times), and while he can be difficult at times he mostly isn&#39;t that bad.Similarly I won my first two Chairman games and no-one can say he&#39;s too easy.&nbsp;

